  "body": "### Description\r\n\r\nVery occasionally, multiple users will have multiple devices signed out and will need to sign back in and re-verify. It may be some devices, for some users, or it may be all—this last time it affected every user except for a specific Element web client for one user (but the rest of his devices were affected).\r\n\r\nLogs do not show anything interesting.\r\n\r\nOnly other report I can find of this is https://github.com/matrix-org/synapse/issues/10401. This also [causes the Android version to crash](https://github.com/vector-im/element-android/issues/5701).\r\n\r\n### Steps to reproduce\r\n\r\nNo idea. It has happened 3 or so times over the course of months, there is no obvious commonality between the events.\r\n\r\n### Version information\r\n- **Version**: `{\"server_version\":\"1.55.2\",\"python_version\":\"3.10.2\"}`\r\n- **Install method**: Package manager\r\n- **Platform**: Alpine Linux x86_64, proxied with Nginx",
